<title>UK: Amersham confirms Pharmacia Biotech talks.</title>
<headline>Amersham confirms Pharmacia Biotech talks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>British science and technology group Amersham International Plc said on Friday that it was in talks with Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn Inc on the possible merger of its life sciences division with Pharmacia Biotech.</p>
</text>
